{
  "id": "s04-l04",
  "unit": "s04-conjuncts",
  "title": "Conjuncts 4: ফলা signs and রেফ",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**ফলা** (`fola`) are small forms of য, র and ব that attach to a consonant. **রেফ** is a small form of র that sits on top.\n\n- **য-ফলা ্য** (a little flag on the right) usually **doubles** the consonant before it and is not said as *y*: ধন্যবাদ `dhonnobad`, অন্য `onno` *other*. At the start of a word with া it gives the *a* of *cat*: হ্যাঁ `hya~` *yes*, ব্যাগ `byag`.\n- **র-ফলা ্র** (a short slanted stroke at the bottom) adds an `r` **after** the letter: ছাত্র `chhatro` *student*, গ্রাম `gram` *village*, প্রতিদিন `protidin` *every day*.\n- **রেফ র্** (a hook **on top**) means an `r` **before** the letter: দুর্গাপূজা `durgapuja`, পর্যন্ত `porjonto` *up to*. Under a রেফ, য is a full `j`.\n- **ব-ফলা ্ব** is usually **silent** at the start of a word: স্বামী `shami` *husband*, স্বাধীনতা `shadhinota` *independence*. In the middle of a word it doubles the consonant.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "cj-jofola",
      "bn": "ন্য",
      "tr": "nno",
      "en": "্য (jo-fola) on ন: doubles the n (ধন্যবাদ)",
      "notes": "Bare sign: ্য (U+09CD U+09AF), name jo-fola (য-ফলা). ন্য = ন + ্ + য. Mid-word it doubles the consonant; with া at the start it gives æ (ব্যাগ bæg). Sounds like ন্ন: keep apart in listening tests."
    },
    {
      "id": "cj-rofola",
      "bn": "ত্র",
      "tr": "tro",
      "en": "্র (ro-fola) on ত: t + r (ছাত্র)",
      "notes": "Bare sign: ্র (U+09CD U+09B0), name ro-fola (র-ফলা), a slanted stroke under the letter. ত্র = ত + ্ + র."
    },
    {
      "id": "cj-bofola",
      "bn": "স্ব",
      "tr": "sho",
      "en": "্ব (bo-fola) on স: the ব is silent (স্বামী = shami)",
      "notes": "Bare sign: ্ব (U+09CD U+09AC), name bo-fola (ব-ফলা). At the start of a word it is silent; in the middle it doubles the consonant (বিশ্ব bishsho). স্ব = স + ্ + ব."
    },
    {
      "id": "cj-ref",
      "bn": "র্গ",
      "tr": "rgo",
      "en": "র্ (ref): an r before the consonant, drawn as a hook on top",
      "notes": "Name: ref (রেফ), র + ্ written as a small hook above the next consonant. র্গ = র U+09B0 + ্ + গ U+0997 (দুর্গা durga)."
    }
  ],
